--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library provides the CUDA kernels used to convert image surfaces into the
planar float tensors expected by inference. It converts an RGBA surface to
planar float RGB or BGR while applying the scale factor and mean subtraction,
and runs on a caller supplied CUDA stream.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ Set CUDA_VER in the MakeFile as per platform.
  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvds_cudaimage.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
